  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Enablers Programme (HEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to improved crisis anticipation, prioritisation, preparedness, humanitarian response, and enhanced access to vulnerable groups. ACAPS and the Joint Research Centre (JRC)/INFORM will develop and publish a suite of analytical products that will provide humanitarian actors with key information related to access, risk, and protection, to enable more evidence-based decision making in the sector, and thus improve the overall response, ensuring more people in need are reached with timely, appropriate humanitarian support. The project also seeks to improve humanitarian preparedness by providing key insights into emerging crises and offering thorough analysis on access constraints which may impede humanitarian action.</narrative>
  </description>
